": 1788516383166, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Future Attack Label 0 or 1", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "5zaw0M2uZvAAOL2bkzOl3", "originalText": "Future Attack Label 0 or 1", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "s7bgwrDN8_1ZDYLy-HkEW", "type": "text", "x": 1507.431640625, "y": 25.5, "width": 58.88671875, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aY", "roundness": null, "seed": 600177144, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 104413832, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788516383166, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "INPUT", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "ikodB8P1KBstopkNlyEn7", "originalText": "INPUT", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "GJjn6Q-bJ9FsNMnGwDbjM", "type": "text", "x": 1498.232421875, "y": 150.5, "width": 77.28515625, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aZ", "roundness": null, "seed": 1248782584, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 15962616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788516383166, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TARGET", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "qiNeZwLSOwBxnIORlynkB", "originalText": "TARGET", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "titleText", "type": "text", "x": 8, "y": -100, "width": 1400, "height": 45, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b0", "roundness": null, "seed": 1606410752, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1481194925, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Attack Forecasting Pipeline (CIC-IDS2018)", "fontSize": 36, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Attack Forecasting Pipeline (CIC-IDS2018)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "subtitleText", "type": "text", "x": 8, "y": -52, "width": 1400, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b1", "roundness": null, "seed": 396312941, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 657765795, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Goal: forecast an attack before it happens, not just detect it after.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Goal: forecast an attack before it happens, not just detect it after.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "briefBox", "type": "rectangle", "x": 8, "y": 300, "width": 1140, "height": 320, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b2", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 450967146, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 58109810, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "briefText", "type": "text", "x": 32, "y": 320, "width": 1092, "height": 280, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b3", "roundness": null, "seed": 169095443, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1832643621, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WHAT WE'RE ACTUALLY BUILDING\n\n-  The raw CSV only tells us what happened NOW (current flow label).\n-  We engineer a NEW label ourselves: does an attack happen in the\n    NEXT window? That's the future_attack target.\n-  Blue path = past traffic features -> INPUT.\n    Amber path = future window outcome -> TARGET.\n-  LightGBM is a valid forecasting baseline ONLY if it was trained\n    on the future target, not the current label.\n-  Next step: compare LightGBM vs LSTM/Transformer on\n    Precision / Recall / F1 as a stronger project story.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHAT WE'RE ACTUALLY BUILDING\n\n-  The raw CSV only tells us what happened NOW (current flow label).\n-  We engineer a NEW label ourselves: does an attack happen in the\n    NEXT window? That's the future_attack target.\n-  Blue path = past traffic features -> INPUT.\n    Amber path = future window outcome -> TARGET.\n-  LightGBM is a valid forecasting baseline ONLY if it was trained\n    on the future target, not the current label.\n-  Next step: compare LightGBM vs LSTM/Transformer on\n    Precision / Recall / F1 as a stronger project story.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "questionBox", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1250, "y": 300, "width": 1150, "height": 320, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b4", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 73356927, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1999422626, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "questionText", "type": "text", "x": 1274, "y": 320, "width": 1102, "height": 280, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b5", "roundness": null, "seed": 1901013982, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1278225865, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788514960619, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ONE QUESTION TO NAIL IN THE MEETING\n\n\"Past 30 sec of traffic -> what exactly is the target?\"\n\npredicts CURRENT window's label            ->  wrong, that's detection\npredicts FUTURE 30-60s attack (0/1)         ->  correct, that's forecasting\n\nIf his LightGBM model was trained on the future target,\nkeep it as-is and use it as our baseline.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ONE QUESTION TO NAIL IN THE MEETING\n\n\"Past 30 sec of traffic -> what exactly is the target?\"\n\npredicts CURRENT window's label            ->  wrong, that's detection\npredicts FUTURE 30-60s attack (0/1)         ->  correct, that's forecasting\n\nIf his LightGBM model was trained on the future target,\nkeep it as-is and use it as our baseline.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}